{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03940","headline":"奉和九日登慈恩寺浮图应制 · 李适","name":"奉和九日登慈恩寺浮图应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤辇乘朝霁，鹦林对晚秋。\n天文贝叶写，圣泽菊花浮。\n塔似神功造，龛疑佛影留。\n幸陪清汉跸，欣奉净居游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}